    "title": "Andy's Adventures: Crab snaring on the Oregon coast - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andy Carson ,\n13 hours ago\nNETARTS Ore. (KPTV) - Crabbing along the Oregon coast is a popular pastime, especially during the fall and winter months. One local man has a unique take on how to capture crustaceans. In this Andy’s Adventures, Andy Carson travels to Netarts to learn about the art of crab snaring.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
